        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ 6-P-03 Rim Cylinder Pull Plate for 6300 Exit Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Night Latch Function Pull Trim with Rim Lock Cylinder (turn key to retract latch, release/remove key to engage latch) for PDQ 6300 series: For use with PDQ <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-rim-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-6300r\"><b>6300 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a> and PDQ <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-surface-vertical-rod-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-6300v\"><b>6300 Series Surface Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>. Packaged with  mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with rim lock cylinder, pull plate,  mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for PDQ 6-P-03 Rim Cylinder Pull Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Function: Night Latch - Turn key to retract door latch on exit device, release/remove key to re-engage.</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Optional Satin Stainless Steel or Dark Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Pull Plate Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Plate Width: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rim Cylinder: Schlage C Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Includes Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n<li>Includes Trim Ring</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/6-p-temp.pdf?v=1718159615\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 6-P Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
